{"id":396,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"DEEP学習と探究で科学的な考えを深める附属中","feature_description":"横浜サイエンスフロンティア高等学校附属中学校は、理数科高校の教育理念を受け、一般中学校と同じ教科を学びながら内容を深く掘り下げます。学校案内では、問いを立て、調べ、考察し、発表する「DEEP学習」や、サイエンススタディーズ、フロンティアタイムを紹介しています。探究を通じ、科学的な見方と自ら学ぶ姿勢を育てます。一学級の人数を抑えた学びを通じて、仲間との関係づくりや自ら考える力を伸ばすことも目指しています。","clubs":[],"profile_sources":[{"id":3188,"attribute_key":"feature_summary","source_url":"https://www.edu.city.yokohama.lg.jp/school/jhs/hs-sf/index.cfm/18,1765,c,html/1765/20240826-140442.pdf","source_kind":"official_site","external_school_code":null,"verified_at":"2026-11-16","source_excerpt":null,"fetched_at":null,"content_hash":null,"invalidated_at":null,"priority":null},{"id":3189,"attribute_key":"feature_description","source_url":"https://www.edu.city.yokohama.lg.jp/school/jhs/hs-sf/index.cfm/18,1765,c,html/1765/20240826-140442.pdf","source_kind":"official_site","external_school_code":null,"verified_at":"2026-11-16","source_excerpt":null,"fetched_at":null,"content_hash":null,"invalidated_at":null,"priority":null},{"id":3787,"attribute_key":"lunch_type","source_url":"https://www.edu.city.yokohama.lg.jp/school/jhs/hs-sf/index.cfm/18,0,68,html","source_kind":"official_site","external_school_code":null,"verified_at":"2026-11-16","source_excerpt":null,"fetched_at":null,"content_hash":null,"invalidated_at":null,"priority":null}]}
